{
  "description": "Observations to the London Borough of Lambeth for: Variation of conditions 2, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 18, 19, 28, 32, 34, 49, 57 and 69 (Approved Plans) of planning permission ref: 16/05114/FUL  (Demolition of existing buildings and redevelopment of the site to provide a residential led mixed use development in a building to the North/North East and a building to the South (fronting onto Wyvil Road) comprising residential accommodation (Class C3), office (Class E(g)(i) and retail floorspace (flexible use Class E(a), E(b) and E(c)). Provision of basement, together with servicing, car parking and provision of areas of public realm and associated works.) granted on 06.09.2017. Variation sought: Alteration to footprint of buildings. Alteration to form and architecture of Building B\r\nChange to materials of buildings. Additional one-storey added to Building B but remaining within approved AOD. Additional residential dwelling added to typical Building B floor plan. Reduction in commercial space provision within. Building C and increase of two-storeys to provide more housing. Increase of 69 homes. Additional stair and lift requirement now incorporated into Building A, B, and C. Increase in plant and cycle space requirements. Revised energy strategy Parking access moved from Wyvil Road to north of Site and parking levels reduced and Reduction in size of basement - from two storeys to one partial basement.",
